            "sid": "REV 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye náona malaika anatserera kula mlunguni, naye kala akagbwira funguwo za kuzimu na silisili kulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi ye malaika warigbwira ro dzoka, yani yuyatu nyoka wa kare aihwaye Ibilisi au Shetani, achirifunga silisili na achiritsupha kuzimu. Pho mryangoni achiphafunga kufuli na kuphatiya ukaka, ili asedze akachenga tsona atu a mataifa ganjina gosi duniani. Naye Shetani andafungbwa miaka elufu mwenga. Bada ya muda hinyo kusira, ni lazima avugulwe kpwa muda mchache tu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.2+REV.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.2",
              "REV.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
